  "post_title": "Este viernes acaba la 1ª fase de inscripción a la II Carrera de Montaña de Villamalur",
  "post_date": "2015-05-14 12:59:30",
  "post_name": "este-viernes-acaba-la-1%c2%aa-fase-de-inscripicion-de-la-ii-carrera-de-montana-de-villamalur",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">Este viernes, 15 de mayo, acaba el primer plazo de inscripci&oacute;n a la II Carrera de Monta&ntilde;a de Villamalur, al precio de 12&euro;. Del 16 al 27 de mayo, apuntarse costar&aacute; 15&euro;.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/CarreraMontañaVillamalurDomingo31.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 680px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">La carrera ser&aacute; el 31 de Mayo desde las 9 horas por todo el t&eacute;rmino de Villamalur. La distancia son 16.8Km, con un desnivel positivo de 680m. </span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/SalidaCarreraMontañaVillamalur-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">El a&ntilde;o pasado (edici&oacute;n a la que correponde la foto y las 61 de la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes de abajo) participaron unas 300 personas y la Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas, organizadora de la Carrera junto al Ayuntamiento de Villamalur, se ha propuesto repetir esta cifra o incluso superarla.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2674.jpg\" alt=\"img_2674\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2675.jpg\" alt=\"img_2675\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2676.jpg\" alt=\"img_2676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2677.jpg\" alt=\"img_2677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2678.jpg\" alt=\"img_2678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2679.jpg\" alt=\"img_2679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2680.jpg\" alt=\"img_2680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2682.jpg\" alt=\"img_2682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2683.jpg\" alt=\"img_2683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2684.jpg\" alt=\"img_2684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2685.jpg\" alt=\"img_2685\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2686.jpg\" alt=\"img_2686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2687.jpg\" alt=\"img_2687\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2688.jpg\" alt=\"img_2688\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2689.jpg\" alt=\"img_2689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/icarreramontanavillamalur2014/img_2690.jpg\" alt=\"